    "text": "Former Madison Ridgeland Academy athlete Evie Ewing appears on Ole Miss women's soccer roster for week ending Sept. 6\nBy\nD. M. ChinEvie Ewing, a former Madison Ridgeland Academy athlete, is listed with the Ole Miss women's soccer program for the week ending Sept. 6, when the team is scheduled to host South Alabama on Sept. 3.\nThe week's schedule lists two events for Ewing with the Ole Miss women's soccer team.\nBoth matches are home games for Ole Miss, set for Sept. 3 against South Alabama and Sept. 6 against Belmont in Oxford, Mississippi.",
    "summary": "Former Madison Ridgeland Academy athlete Evie Ewing appears on Ole Miss women's soccer roster for week ending Sept. 6 D. M. ChinEvie Ewing, a former Madison Ridgeland Academy athlete, is listed with the Ole Miss women's soccer program for the week ending Sept. 6, when the team is scheduled to host South Alabama on Sept. 3. The week's schedule lists two events for Ewing with the Ole Miss women's soccer team. Both matches are home games for Ole Miss, set for Sept. 3 against South Alabama and Sept. 6 against Belmont in Oxford, Mississippi.",
